Source: rog-apt-config
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: HDR Engineering <hdr-engineering@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gpg, python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/pjunod/rog_hdr_dv

Package: rog-apt-config
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: APT source, signing key and pins for the rog-hdr repository
 Installs the deb822 source for the rog-hdr package repository, its public
 signing key, and the apt preferences that decide which of its packages a
 machine takes: listed packages that replace Ubuntu packages at 1001, other
 listed packages at 500, and nothing else from the repository.
 .
 The repository needs a read credential, which this package does not
 install: it belongs in /etc/apt/auth.conf.d/rog-hdr.conf, mode 0600.
